{
  "_readme": [
    "Fixed question set, written 2026-11-05 before scoring. Each question has a known right answer.",
    "Checks: `answer` (a field equals a value), `top3` (one of the first 3 results matches every given condition),",
    "`field` (a dotted path equals a value), `min` (a dotted path is at least a number), `none` (no result matches).",
    "Invariants checked on every result of every question: nothing dead or refused-as-out-of-state is reported as live, and no dataset whose extent lies wholly outside New York is returned.",
    "`top3_any`: one of the first 3 results matches any one of the listed condition sets."
  ],
  "questions": [
    {
      "id": "Q01",
      "q": "Does Erie County publish parcel data?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "list_sources_for_place",
          "args": {
            "place": "Erie County",
            "include_statewide": false
          },
          "check": {
            "answer": [
              "answer",
              "no-portal-exists"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "tool": "search_datasets",
          "args": {
            "query": "tax parcels",
            "place": "Erie County"
          },
          "check": {
            "top3": {
              "name": "NYS Tax Parcels Public"
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "note": "Erie has no portal; the right parcel source is the statewide 'NYS Tax Parcels Public' layer. Made strict at 13:30 after the final run showed a lax pass on Oswego's parcels (disclosed in the report)."
    },
    {
      "id": "Q02",
      "q": "What is the Socrata domain for state health data?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "how_to_query",
          "args": {
            "entity": "NYS Department of Health"
          },
          "check": {
            "field": [
              "use.domain",
              "health.data.ny.gov"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q03",
      "q": "Which NY portals have anything on lead pipes?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "search_datasets",
          "args": {
            "query": "lead service lines"
          },
          "check": {
            "top3": {
              "name": "lead"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "Q04",
      "q": "What joins to 311 by BBL?",
      "steps": [
        {
          "tool": "find_joinable",
          "args": {
            "dataset": "erm2-nwe9",
            "column": "BBL"
          },
          "check": {
            "min": [
              "keys.0.datasets_sharing_key",
              100
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
